@startuml

title 09. Stock reservations and availability

hide circle
skinparam linetype ortho

enum StockReservationStatus {
	active
	completed
	canceled
	expired
}

entity StockReservation {
	* id: int
	--
	* quantity: decimal(14,4)
	* status: StockReservationStatus
	* reservedAt: DateTimeImmutable
	expiresAt: DateTimeImmutable?
	* orderEntry: OrderEntry
	* warehouseStock: WarehouseStock
}

OrderEntry ||--o{ StockReservation : reserves
WarehouseStock ||--o{ StockReservation : reserved from
StockReservationStatus ||--o{ StockReservation : controls

note right of StockReservation
  Current project status:
  - StockReservation is implemented.
  - WarehouseStock.reservedQuantity is updated
    by active reservation lifecycle changes.
  - Order confirmation reserves stock-backed entries.
  - Return to draft and cancel release active reservations.
  - Sale shipment posting completes matching active reservations.
  - Store.allowBackorders exists.

  Implemented behavior:
  - quantity > 0.
  - active reservations contribute to reservedQuantity.
  - completed/canceled/expired reservations do not count.
  - active reservations must not exceed available stock:
    quantityOnHand - reservedQuantity.
  - Backorders are allowed at OrderEntry level only;
    WarehouseStock itself must never go negative.
  - OrderEntry can remain unreserved when allowBackorders=true.
  - Shipment posting completes matching active reservations,
    including partial reservation completion.
  - awaiting_stock/ready_to_ship synchronization is handled
    by 08.1 BusinessDocumentStatusSynchronizer.
end note

note bottom
  Suggested implementation steps:

  Done:

  1. Added StockReservation entity, enum and repository.
  2. Added StockReservationService:
     reserve(orderEntry, warehouseStock, quantity),
     release(reservation),
     complete(reservation),
     expireOldReservations().
  3. Updated Order confirmation workflow to reserve available stock.
  4. Added tests for over-reservation, partial reservation,
     release, expiration and backorders.
  5. Completed reservations from sale shipment posting.
  6. Re-evaluated awaiting_stock/ready_to_ship through
     08.1 progress synchronization.
end note

@enduml
